{"id":"2389ec47066b5352","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Lusin Scheme","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme — ZFC Descriptive2 Lusin Scheme","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme — ZFC Descriptive2 Lusin Scheme","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme — ZFC Descriptive2 Lusin Scheme"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (underlying space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topology; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,H\\in V\">\\(U,H\\in V\\)</span> (scheme assignment and finite-sequence carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in H\">\\(s\\in H\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (indices bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2LusinScheme}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2LusinScheme}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}scheme} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2LusinScheme}_S(U,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,\\tau)\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\Bigl(U(s)=\\bigcup\\{U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),n\\rangle\\}):n\\in\\omega\\}\\Bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(n\\neq m\\to U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),n\\rangle\\})\\cap U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),m\\rangle\\})=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}scheme} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2LusinScheme}_S(U,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,\\tau)\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\Bigl(U(s)=\\bigcup\\{U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),n\\rangle\\}):n\\in\\omega\\}\\Bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(n\\neq m\\to U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),n\\rangle\\})\\cap U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),m\\rangle\\})=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite sequences are bounded function graphs, and one-step extension is the explicit graph union at the next domain index.  The children form a pairwise-disjoint open partition of the parent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)$ with $\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ (topology; see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"U,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2LusinScheme}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}lusin\\text{-}scheme} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2LusinScheme}_S(U,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,H,\\tau)\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\Bigl(U(s)=\\bigcup\\{U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),n\\rangle\\}):n\\in\\omega\\}\\Bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in H\\;\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(n\\neq m\\to U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),n\\rangle\\})\\cap U(s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),m\\rangle\\})=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1708,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1811","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive2-lusin-scheme]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","815e63e5071e7b58","36d7463d215be751","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}